  "title": "DynamicAnimation Shooting Template [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "DynamicAnimation 射撃系テンプレート【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "bff45560e941f814642355e93d9f0c44fec9d57aeafbba8e4e58255ed89738aa",
      "translation": "DynamicAnimation Shooting Template [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "bff45560e941f814642355e93d9f0c44fec9d57aeafbba8e4e58255ed89738aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "射撃系（投擲系）のテンプレートの使用例を紹介していきます。",
      "sourceHash": "92b19a43c97e20b6d24c284fc441c42296da33107678783ce2770b2888c36ddd",
      "translation": "I will introduce examples of using shooting (throwing) templates.",
      "contextHash": "92b19a43c97e20b6d24c284fc441c42296da33107678783ce2770b2888c36ddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "射撃（shot）",
      "sourceHash": "0633a15601446a07d932496d8df6afc3c04a4635c4971ab9dee56b9cb68b8481",
      "translation": "Shooting (shot)",
      "contextHash": "0633a15601446a07d932496d8df6afc3c04a4635c4971ab9dee56b9cb68b8481"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "行動主体から対象へ向かって、まっすぐにアニメーションが飛んでいきます。",
      "sourceHash": "00ce9a70892b54004d7921b2623ab5618ca9977fb2cbdd7f5c2d6ba74559165c",
      "translation": "The animation flies straight from the action subject toward the target.",
      "contextHash": "00ce9a70892b54004d7921b2623ab5618ca9977fb2cbdd7f5c2d6ba74559165c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "射撃系の最も基本的な処理です。",
      "sourceHash": "b5f9ed231cc3090f0a9575ea89f0c51151d8152a801472a4f5931a120000229a",
      "translation": "This is the most basic shooting-type process.",
      "contextHash": "b5f9ed231cc3090f0a9575ea89f0c51151d8152a801472a4f5931a120000229a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "乱射（shotRandom）",
      "sourceHash": "35ee46656c4a703a78fab61d6c75cef6c085a79d0c5b06d5c409cdc546d68881",
      "translation": "Random Barrage (shotRandom)",
      "contextHash": "35ee46656c4a703a78fab61d6c75cef6c085a79d0c5b06d5c409cdc546d68881"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象へ向かってアニメーションを乱れ撃ちします。",
      "sourceHash": "47ada894020af7b21d279befa7d617f50cafdc48e7297ca008955f713e2d3b5c",
      "translation": "It fires a barrage of animations toward the target.",
      "contextHash": "47ada894020af7b21d279befa7d617f50cafdc48e7297ca008955f713e2d3b5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "arrival = 7 // 到達フレーム",
      "sourceHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af",
      "translation": "arrival = 7 // Target frame",
      "contextHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "shotに対して、既に説明した内容を組合わせたものです。以下と違いは一切ありません。",
      "sourceHash": "07dc8a00ed30b3ca100632e2917621a84b55f1fe0caeb6eb1f1e72a83ccf5916",
      "translation": "This is simply a combination of the features already explained for shot. There is absolutely no difference from the following.",
      "contextHash": "07dc8a00ed30b3ca100632e2917621a84b55f1fe0caeb6eb1f1e72a83ccf5916"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "repeat = 5 // 繰返回数",
      "sourceHash": "923b80c3fa5dbf3ad48b4d83319f60b56262f24e5a9811c60254387e5e1a1562",
      "translation": "repeat = 5 // Repeat count",
      "contextHash": "923b80c3fa5dbf3ad48b4d83319f60b56262f24e5a9811c60254387e5e1a1562"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-003",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "exRandom = b.width / 3 // 終点Ｘ座標分散",
      "sourceHash": "e46e42a19047aee59462f16a81d48573f58a9803b5b0495ecf13e489a570a1f2",
      "translation": "exRandom = b.width / 3 // Endpoint X-coordinate variance",
      "contextHash": "e46e42a19047aee59462f16a81d48573f58a9803b5b0495ecf13e489a570a1f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-004",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "eyRandom = b.height / 3 // 終点Ｙ座標分散",
      "sourceHash": "f49c04786df3c7445fd301d71dc2f4388e3e16d03ea56c89ca0ad9920122a3ef",
      "translation": "eyRandom = b.height / 3 // Endpoint Y-coordinate variance",
      "contextHash": "f49c04786df3c7445fd301d71dc2f4388e3e16d03ea56c89ca0ad9920122a3ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "repeatやintervalの値を好きなように変えて使っていただければと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "f7795fe480cbf0bbf5ff5ce1f297a88cde660706dab08b698206f46c8ee0d43d",
      "translation": "You can change the values of repeat and interval as you like before using it.",
      "contextHash": "f7795fe480cbf0bbf5ff5ce1f297a88cde660706dab08b698206f46c8ee0d43d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "全乱射（shotRandomAll）",
      "sourceHash": "023e097c4bac9416849a9b18a100b36c983b11fe3010918630e76034d1f7b059",
      "translation": "All-Target Random Barrage (shotRandomAll)",
      "contextHash": "023e097c4bac9416849a9b18a100b36c983b11fe3010918630e76034d1f7b059"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象全体に対して、乱射します。",
      "sourceHash": "6234221ef788582ccbbed3f57f90a4b54087dd37e37af87cdb2dc83135e6045c",
      "translation": "It fires a barrage at all targets.",
      "contextHash": "6234221ef788582ccbbed3f57f90a4b54087dd37e37af87cdb2dc83135e6045c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-005",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "arrival = 7 // 到達フレーム",
      "sourceHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af",
      "translation": "arrival = 7 // Target frame",
      "contextHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "大量のアニメーションを呼び出すため、重くなりやすいです。その辺りの注意点については『ランダム系テンプレート』のページで説明するため、こちらでは割愛します。",
      "sourceHash": "d677413e0aedbe11f8aae6eccf2ee4c09cf56a0d0b9d4d616115971a18344b25",
      "translation": "Because it calls a large number of animations, it tends to become heavy. I will explain the relevant points to keep in mind on the “Random Templates” page, so I will omit them here.",
      "contextHash": "d677413e0aedbe11f8aae6eccf2ee4c09cf56a0d0b9d4d616115971a18344b25"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "投射（arc）",
      "sourceHash": "d13b7aec9eda8051b1534f40838fd9490c5d5a25add8e25b3c212133f959e511",
      "translation": "Arc Projectile (arc)",
      "contextHash": "d13b7aec9eda8051b1534f40838fd9490c5d5a25add8e25b3c212133f959e511"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "放物線を描きながら、対象へアニメーションを投げつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "767387815df591f424cacb1ab45dd12b32af8c9a77fb4ec86176deb5994e480f",
      "translation": "It throws an animation at the target while drawing a parabola.",
      "contextHash": "767387815df591f424cacb1ab45dd12b32af8c9a77fb4ec86176deb5994e480f"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-006",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "arrival = 7 // 到達フレーム",
      "sourceHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af",
      "translation": "arrival = 7 // Target frame",
      "contextHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "はい、これも上で紹介したものと全く同じですね。『arcY = -100』をshot型に対して追加しただけです。",
      "sourceHash": "9a271bfeef432626c08194fe5ccd3dbc17d039eff419c967bec3d2e627b14a04",
      "translation": "Yes, this is exactly the same as the one introduced above. I simply added “arcY = -100” to the shot type.",
      "contextHash": "9a271bfeef432626c08194fe5ccd3dbc17d039eff419c967bec3d2e627b14a04"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "乱投射（arcRandom）",
      "sourceHash": "6d3418f5f1da39ab197cc359c9e06f00ec8f3f9c4364b812ddc2b914fcfafd0c",
      "translation": "Random Arc Projectile (arcRandom)",
      "contextHash": "6d3418f5f1da39ab197cc359c9e06f00ec8f3f9c4364b812ddc2b914fcfafd0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-007",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "arrival = 7 // 到達フレーム",
      "sourceHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af",
      "translation": "arrival = 7 // Target frame",
      "contextHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "arcとshotRandomを組み合わせただけですね。",
      "sourceHash": "cf9a0cc247f2ea58a33b277b07653da8ef2c4d8dbd479624c4273e5cb6515e49",
      "translation": "It simply combines arc and shotRandom.",
      "contextHash": "cf9a0cc247f2ea58a33b277b07653da8ef2c4d8dbd479624c4273e5cb6515e49"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "全乱投射（arcRandomAll）",
      "sourceHash": "694bdcde8b5c50e5c6ac7e4461728345dc8fd7bb643d5e0ca56f6a981f281ca9",
      "translation": "All-Target Random Arc Projectile (arcRandomAll)",
      "contextHash": "694bdcde8b5c50e5c6ac7e4461728345dc8fd7bb643d5e0ca56f6a981f281ca9"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-008",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "arrival = 7 // 到達フレーム",
      "sourceHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af",
      "translation": "arrival = 7 // Target frame",
      "contextHash": "4eb91bab97c4e37e494394e0fe599813647ea6b449a87e2d1e7f38e87a4878af"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "全乱射の放物線バージョンです。",
      "sourceHash": "b3ffc85c8078234f619fcc7eada2b601b761a8ca6af8453fb8ba049a925c867b",
      "translation": "This is the parabolic version of the all-target random barrage.",
      "contextHash": "b3ffc85c8078234f619fcc7eada2b601b761a8ca6af8453fb8ba049a925c867b"
    }
  ],
